Subject: [PATCH] RFC: apple: arbitrate native ports and DP-IN after DRM readiness

Local development candidate after native HPD patches 1-3.
No automatic enablement: requires explicit experimental device tree.
Full system suspend and HPD IRQ forwarding remain unsupported.
Not upstream-ready; hardware validation required before deployment.

---
